ces and potential threats from any direction<br>- Roomscale experience. No need to worry about motion sickness!</p>", "short_description": "NIGHT OF THE WENDIGO is a Virtual Reality horror experience in which a peaceful day of hiking becomes a night of survival! The game is a very simple VR experience that is best enjoyed by taking turns with friends.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/header.jpg?t=1747955552", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/3169900b9284c288a2f71244db04a9f74af75d71/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747955552", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3440790/3169900b9284c288a2f71244db04a9f74af75d71/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747955552", "website": "https://nekomatagames.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4590/AMD FX 8350 equivalent or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD Radeon R9 290<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR or Oculus PC</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Nekomata Games LLC"], "publishers": ["Nekomata Games LLC"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted":